gular/pull/28207 the CI complains that the golden file is not up to date, and that I need to run the bazel command to update it.\r\nI did that the first time, it updated the golden file, but the CI still asks for an update (both locally and on CircleCI). I tried to rerun the script, it ends successfully but it doesn't change the file anymore.\r\n\r\nThe error is either that it should update the file and doesn't, or the script used to check the content of the file is wrong and the golden file is correct.\r\n\r\n\r\n## 🔬 Minimal Reproduction\r\nCheckout my PR: https://github.com/angular/angular/pull/28207\r\nTry to update the golden file with `yarn bazel run --define=compile=aot //packages/core/test/bundling/injection:symbol_test.accept`, it doesn't change anything.\r\nRun the tests with `yarn test-ivy-aot //...`, it should fail.\r\n\r\n## 🔥 Exception or Error\r\nSee https://circleci.com/gh/angular/angular/170261\r\n\r\n<pre><code>\r\nFAILED: //packages/core/test/bundling/injection:symbol_test (Summary)\r\n      /home/circleci/.cache/bazel/_bazel_circleci/9ce5c2144ecf75d11717c0aa41e45a8d/execroot/angular/bazel-out/k8-fastbuild/testlogs/packages/core/test/bundling/injection/symbol_test/test_attempts/attempt_1.log\r\n      /home/circleci/.cache/bazel/_bazel_circleci/9ce5c2144ecf75d11717c0aa41e45a8d/execroot/angular/bazel-out/k8-fastbuild/testlogs/packages/core/test/bundling/injection/symbol_test/test.log\r\nFAIL: //packages/core/test/bundling/injection:symbol_test (see /home/circleci/.cache/bazel/_bazel_circleci/9ce5c2144ecf75d11717c0aa41e45a8d/execroot/angular/bazel-out/k8-fastbuild/testlogs/packages/core/test/bundling/injection/symbol_test/test.log)\r\nINFO: From Testing //packages/core/test/bundling/injection:symbol_test:\r\n==================== Test output for //packages/core/test/bundling/injection:symbol_test:\r\nExpected symbols in '/b/f/w/bazel-out/k8-fastbuild/bin/packages/core/test/bundling/injection/symbol_test.sh.runfiles/angular/packages/core/test/bundling/injection/bundle.min_debug.js' did not match gold file.\r\n   Symbol: CIRCULAR => extra\r\n   Symbol: NULL_INJECTOR => extra\r\nTEST FAILED!\r\n  To update the golden file run: \r\n    yarn bazel run --define=compile=aot //packages/core/test/bundling/injection:symbol_test.accept\r\n\r\n</code></pre>","closed_by":{"login":"matsko","id":93018,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkzMDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93018?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matsko","html_url":"https://github.com/matsko","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matsko/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matsko/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matsko/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matsko/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matsko/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matsko/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matsko/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matsko/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matsko/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/28406/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/28406/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}